maxHandoffs? }) returns { run, on, bus, agents, entry }. run(task) resolves { output, finalAgent, path, handoffs, usage }. Routing loops are bounded by maxHandoffs (default 8)."},"296":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-294","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#evaluating-agents-evaluate-scorers","content":"evaluate(target, cases, opts?) runs a suite through an agent and returns a pass/fail EvalReport — test agent behaviour like any other code."},"297":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-295","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#evaluating-agents-evaluate-scorers","content":"target is a single Agent (reused) or a factory () => Agent (fresh, auto-closed per case). opts.concurrency runs cases in parallel. A failing scorer or a thrown run is recorded as a failed case — the suite never crashes."},"298":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-296","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#evaluating-agents-evaluate-scorers","content":"Built-in scorers: contains, matches, equals, toolCalled, toolNotCalled, noToolErrors, maxCost, maxToolCalls, custom. A per-case output zod schema scores structured results with equals."},"299":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-297","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#events","content":"stream:start, stream:token, stream:end"},"300":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-298","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#events","content":"thinking:start, thinking:delta, thinking:end"},"301":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-299","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#events","content":"tool:call, tool:result, tool:error"},"302":{"id":"/docs/config-reference-300","page_id":"/docs/config-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-reference#events","content":"mcp:servers:change