 is upcoming."],[1499,"@agentkit/runtime"],[2005,"@agentkit/runtime"],[2136,"@agentkit/runtime is the agent microkernel: a session log, a tool pipeline, prompt assembly, a model seam, and a loop — each one an ordinary plugin on the kernel."],[2219,"@agentkit/runtime ships only MemorySessionStore so it stays edge-capable. The Node-side implementations of the same seam live in @agentkit/core:"],[469,"@agentkit/server"],[1541,"@agentkit/server"],[1233,"@agentkit/server has four entry points with the same routes and hardening (body limit, random session ids, session cap, auth, tenant isolation, error mapping):"],[23,"@agentkit/svelte"],[475,"@agentkit/svelte"],[1399,"@agentkit/svelte stores"],[22,"@agentkit/vue"],[473,"@agentkit/vue"],[1437,"@agentkit/vue composables"],[477,"@agentkit/workspace"],[1282,"/answer"],[1279,"/approvals?sessionId=…"],[1276,"/approve / /reject"],[1321,"/artifacts?sessionId=…"],[1285,"/cancel"],[1243,"/capabilities"],[1267,"/events?sessionId=…"],[1270,"/events/all"],[1240,"/health"],[1540,"/health"],[1288,"/history?sessionId=…"],[1312,"/mcp"],[1318,"/mcp/:id/tools"],[1315,"/mcp/connect, /mcp/disconnect, /mcp/reload, /mcp/add, /mcp/remove, /mcp/auth"],[1291,"/mode"],[328,"/models"],[1246,"/models"],[1111,"/models/*"],[336,"/models/add"],[1252,"/models/add / /models/remove"],[332,"/models/default"],[1249,"/models/default"],[344,"/models/refresh"],[1258,"/models/refresh"],[340,"/models/test"],[1255,"/models/test"],[1261,"/models/usage"],[1109,"/rag/* (ingest posts { docs })"],[1327,"/rag/ingest, /rag/query"],[1324,"/rag/sources"],[1297,"/saveWorkflow"],[1273,"/send"],[1264,"/session"],[1294,"/todo/edit"],[2117,"/tree inside the CLI (or --tree at startup) shows what actually loaded and what any blocked plugin is still waiting for."],[1300,"/workflows, /workflows/:id"],[1303,"/workflows/:id"],[1309,"/workflows/generate"],[1306,"/workflows/run"],[1810,"#"],[1516,"~/.agentkit/settings.json, project agentkit.settings.json searched upward, flags on top"],[576,"0"],[2344,"0.82"],[35,"0.85"],[579,"1"],[1814,"1"],[1850,"10"],[1854,"11"],[1858,"12"],[1862,"13"],[1866,"14"],[1870,"15"],[1874,"16"],[1878,"17"],[1882,"18"],[1886,"19"],[582,"2"],[1818,"2"],[2341,"2"],[121,"2 retries, 500ms→8s backoff"],[1890,"20"],[178,"2048"],[1894,"21"],[1898,"22"],[585,"3"],[1822,"3"],[1826,"4"],[1377,"404 on /events: session expired server-side; POST /session again."],[1830,"5"],[1834,"6"],[1838,"7"],[1842,"8"],[1846,"9"],[1867,"A big catalogue the model discovers when it needs it"],[1567,"A bundle is the same composition expressed as data: an ordered list of rows, each with an id."],[761,"A catalogue in the system prompt: one line per MCP server or category, with a count and\nexample names, so the model knows what exists:\n- github (40): list_issues, create_pull_request, …"],[1879,"A ceiling the loop does not know about"],[670,"A Claude-style chat app (Next.js UI + a small Node agent server) that uses every feature in one place: thinking, tools, approvals, questions, Plan mode, a sandboxed workspace, MCP management, workflows and telemetry. It runs offline on a scripted mock or live on any provider key in .env."],[1116,"A ClientSession for id (the same object per id): every call carries id, on / onAny see that session's events plus agent-wide ones (MCP, models) from the shared stream, send / answer emit client:send / client:answer, workflows.run closes the run in the hub's state when it returns. Pass it to any store or hook. Its close() detaches its listeners only"],[727,"A command that exits non-zero comes back with its exit code and output for the model, marked isError: true with the line that explains it (exited with code 1: Error: Cannot find module …), so it shows as a failed call in traces."],[1561,"A composition as data, so someone else can retune it without forking you"],[1456,"a computed list of audit rows"],[1460,"a computed plan"],[2062,"A config that fails to parse fails that plugin's fiber and leaves the rest of the tree